30:| ZR16 — C, independent reproducibility and assurance | Native APIs SHALL distinguish compiled, synthesized, proved, outer-verified, fully verified and ledger-finalized evidence and expose retained proof/statement artifacts for independent final verification with pinned dependencies. | Independent verifier accepts retained valid two-step MC03 proof and MC06 split/join proof without original prover service; tampered statement/proof/key rejects. A simulation, mock proof or outer-only success never receives final-valid status. | Scoped proving examples and financial receipts exist; this end-to-end public developer evidence remains open. |
