   707	  "unresolved": [
   708	    "Ledger-accepted proofs use a Blake2b transcript that the PR 738 verifier cannot read. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/fable-kernel.md records that limit. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/astra-backend-integration.md records Poseidon-transcript proof preparation in the native verifier. docs/MORIARTY-BACKEND-REQUIREMENTS.md records that a compatible release tuple is unknown.",
   709	    "This row keeps 3fa0d1d15a3cfabd41c806546a006b1ce406b7b2. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/evidence-packet.md records Commit 2026-09-10 for that object. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/astra-backend-requirements.md names it as the inspected midnight-ledger checkout on 19 September 2026. The same observation date also records a8ab82ba2124c36f92795c683e70bd888bc1d1fb in deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/astra-backend-integration.md. deliverables/sp04-native-finalizer-source-2026-09-10/source-evidence.json records that second object at 2026-09-10T18:33:04Z. The 2026-09-19 observations do not uniquely select one ledger git object. deliverables/moriarty-decision-study-2026-09-02.md records the older object 9a8777c4d035fc7f38ae286bcf5f8656668efd9f. experiments/moriarty-midnight-financial/ledger/launch-runtime-pins.json records @midnight-ntwrk/ledger-v8 version 8.1.0. deliverables/sp04-native-finalizer-source-2026-09-10/README.md records retained ledger-9 alternative 0d364eb9f8c388a0399d05f59f2468c96d765015. deliverables/language-design-2026-09-09/wiki-draft/wiki-transaction-final.json records ledger-9 commit 92e8bdd3a97b61b229e38916e1b180de6f448dd5.",
   710	    "This row keeps 7dff84a685cd8baed2e69a2b66ae63573fe5a575. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/astra-backend-requirements.md records that clean tracked working tree on 19 September 2026. docs/MORIARTY-BACKEND-REQUIREMENTS.md records the same hash. deliverables/aeon-study-2026-09-19/PR17-APPLICABILITY.md records 2ffe2d17bbb736aec36fb300aeaca679a10d2278 with assessment date 2026-09-19. deliverables/moriarty-decision-study-2026-09-02.md records that same object on 2026-09-02. The 2026-09-19 observations do not uniquely select one ZKIR git object. deliverables/aeon-study-2026-09-19/PR17-APPLICABILITY.md also names an older surface as 5b593d1. deliverables/language-design-2026-09-09/wiki-draft/wiki-transaction-final.json records midnight-zkir-v3 3.0.0 and cites 04c9c5d9 as 3.0.0-rc.2.",
   711	    "This row keeps observed compactc version 0.31.1 from deliverables/lifecycle-corpus-2026-09-17/environment.json. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/evidence-packet.md also records compiler 0.31.1. That environment file records release zip sha256 e291b4bab4d4e857707008f8b1c25c2b8e0c843f6c737d0ee6c0d9ac69a6bbfb. deliverables/moriarty-compact-dsl-feasibility-and-sdk-specification.md records Compact source commit 11e7ec5abeecb99297c4faa74d30ef9adc7b51f3. deliverables/consolidated-design-2026-09-19/evidence-packet.md cites compactc-v0.34.0 release notes.",
