   191	          "quoteRole": "states-premise",
   192	          "quote": "Requirement: MPLR-030: Common evidence statement and federation trust\nWhen the kernel combines proofs, attestations and signing authority, it SHALL bind them to the same intention, domain, stage, epoch, artifact and exact effects, and expose the threshold, hardware, observation and recovery assumptions."
   193	        }
